<title>GREECE: ATHLETICS-BAGACH WINS WORLD MEN'S SHOT PUT TITLE.</title>
<headline>ATHLETICS-BAGACH WINS WORLD MEN'S SHOT PUT TITLE.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1997-08-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ukrainian Aleksandr Bagach won the men's shot put gold medal on the opening day of the world championships on Saturday.</p>
<p>John Godina of the United States took the silver and German Oliver-Sven Buder the bronze.</p>
</text>
